WEBVTT

00:00:02.480 --> 00:00:04.700
The transaction's complete.

00:00:04.700 --> 00:00:06.860
Thank you for your cooperation.

00:00:05.000 --> 00:00:09.000
<b>This program is a work of fiction. The characters, organizations, locations, cases, etc. being portrayed are unrelated to actual events.</b>

00:00:14.020 --> 00:00:16.000
I just got some information.

00:00:16.000 --> 00:00:19.510
Forget about Ryang-Ha Song for now.

00:00:19.510 --> 00:00:20.700
Nice to meet you.

00:00:22.200 --> 00:00:23.710
Our client was killed.

00:00:51.400 --> 00:00:53.170
Y'know, I feel sorry for you,

00:00:53.170 --> 00:00:56.740
getting into all this trouble because of him.

00:00:58.970 --> 00:01:00.740
Say hi to him for me.

00:01:00.740 --> 00:01:05.570
Tell him, "It's time to 
face the music, traitor."

00:01:14.770 --> 00:01:17.860
Is this all your doing?

00:01:19.610 --> 00:01:21.630
Do you seriously believe it is?

00:03:11.540 --> 00:03:12.770
Morning!

00:03:12.770 --> 00:03:14.770
You sure slept well.

00:03:22.710 --> 00:03:25.190
We still have time until checkout.

00:03:25.190 --> 00:03:26.610
What should we...

00:03:30.630 --> 00:03:32.570
<i>Maybe she's not a morning person.</i>

00:03:34.180 --> 00:03:37.480
By the way, you haven't changed
 since yesterday, have you?

00:03:37.480 --> 00:03:39.490
You and your clothes are covered in mud.

00:03:40.110 --> 00:03:41.570
Why don't you go take a shower?

00:04:08.380 --> 00:04:09.520
Shoot.

00:04:11.060 --> 00:04:13.600
<i>I was attacked, and...</i>

00:04:23.620 --> 00:04:26.510
Is this all your doing?

00:04:27.800 --> 00:04:30.200
<i>I must have fallen asleep.</i>

00:04:35.080 --> 00:04:36.700
<i>He went outside.</i>

00:04:38.510 --> 00:04:39.370
<i>A towel?</i>

00:04:51.540 --> 00:04:52.850
I'm back.

00:04:56.820 --> 00:04:59.700
<i>She's not in the bathroom...</i>

00:05:07.400 --> 00:05:08.790
What are you doing?

00:05:09.300 --> 00:05:10.330
My clothes...

00:05:12.500 --> 00:05:16.200
What did you do with my clothes?

00:05:16.200 --> 00:05:21.130
Well, they were dirty, so I'm getting them 
cleaned at the laundromat right now.

00:05:21.130 --> 00:05:23.130
A-All of them?!

00:05:23.130 --> 00:05:23.960
Yeah.

00:05:23.960 --> 00:05:27.130
I tossed it all in the wash, 
jacket and underwear and all.

00:05:28.630 --> 00:05:33.100
Jacket and underwear and all...

00:05:33.100 --> 00:05:37.110
Wait, is women's underwear 
not machine-washable?

00:05:37.740 --> 00:05:40.230
<i>That's not the point!</i>

00:05:40.230 --> 00:05:42.940
Oh, right. You don't have anything to—

00:05:46.610 --> 00:05:51.620
<i>Yikes. Why is she so angry?</i>

00:05:54.350 --> 00:05:56.500
Here. They're dry.

00:05:57.900 --> 00:05:59.500
They're nice and warm.

00:06:10.220 --> 00:06:11.130
Yes.

00:06:11.480 --> 00:06:13.430
Sorry for worrying you.

00:06:14.680 --> 00:06:17.220
I'll explain further when I get back.

00:06:17.220 --> 00:06:18.390
Goodbye.

00:06:21.180 --> 00:06:22.900
Did you get in trouble?

00:06:23.770 --> 00:06:25.400
For sleeping over?

00:06:29.950 --> 00:06:32.130
Huh? Where are you going?

00:06:32.950 --> 00:06:34.980
They're coming from the office to pick me up.

00:06:34.980 --> 00:06:35.950
What?

00:06:35.950 --> 00:06:38.440
I said I'd give you a ride.

00:06:38.440 --> 00:06:39.750
I never asked.

00:06:39.750 --> 00:06:41.960
Oh, come on.

00:06:43.870 --> 00:06:45.790
Oh, right, hang on.

00:06:45.790 --> 00:06:46.870
You forgot this.

00:06:51.220 --> 00:06:53.220
No wonder I couldn't find it!

00:06:53.220 --> 00:06:55.720
It's completely busted, though.

00:06:55.980 --> 00:06:57.730
And you totaled your car.

00:06:57.730 --> 00:06:59.600
You're gonna be in deep trouble.

00:07:01.950 --> 00:07:03.650
I apologize...

00:07:05.750 --> 00:07:07.170
for...

00:07:08.370 --> 00:07:11.110
all the trouble.

00:07:12.040 --> 00:07:13.490
Wow, didn't expect that.

00:07:14.490 --> 00:07:17.430
But don't sweat it.

00:07:17.860 --> 00:07:20.750
It's not like it cost me anything.

00:07:21.330 --> 00:07:23.390
Except that you got hurt.

00:07:25.030 --> 00:07:28.260
And I think I know why...

00:07:29.460 --> 00:07:30.430
What?

00:07:30.430 --> 00:07:31.760
Never mind.

00:07:32.040 --> 00:07:36.420
Also, I'd prefer thanks to an apology.

00:07:36.820 --> 00:07:41.980
Like a "thank you very much." 
Or an "I'll never forget this."

00:07:43.880 --> 00:07:48.400
By the way, my attacker 
asked me to tell you...

00:07:49.610 --> 00:07:54.030
"It's time to face the music, traitor."

00:07:54.330 --> 00:07:56.870
Perhaps you know what he's talking about.

00:08:00.690 --> 00:08:02.380
Well, if you'll excuse me...

00:08:06.200 --> 00:08:08.710
<i>You could've told me sooner.</i>

00:08:19.950 --> 00:08:23.370
5 Years Ago

00:08:26.150 --> 00:08:27.860
An executive nominee?

00:08:28.080 --> 00:08:29.360
Him?!

00:08:29.360 --> 00:08:31.670
Lower your voice, Hou.

00:08:31.670 --> 00:08:32.760
But...

00:08:32.760 --> 00:08:35.610
The old man is going to announce 
it at the executive meeting today.

00:08:35.610 --> 00:08:37.200
It's already a done deal.

00:08:37.200 --> 00:08:37.870
What?!

00:08:37.870 --> 00:08:40.240
He's only been here for three years!

00:08:40.240 --> 00:08:44.730
I know the boss loves him, 
but that's way too sketchy!

00:08:44.730 --> 00:08:46.750
Calm down, Hou.

00:08:47.000 --> 00:08:49.460
He's still only a nominee.

00:08:49.460 --> 00:08:53.380
It'll be ten, twenty years in the future.

00:08:53.380 --> 00:08:54.870
That's not what I'm...

00:08:57.070 --> 00:08:58.760
Oh, Seung-Woo.

00:08:59.660 --> 00:09:01.010
I've been meaning to talk to you.

00:09:01.330 --> 00:09:04.150
The others said they'd be here soon.

00:09:04.150 --> 00:09:06.330
Could I have a minute of your time?

00:09:06.330 --> 00:09:07.960
Yeah, all right.

00:09:07.960 --> 00:09:08.830
Okay.

00:09:17.590 --> 00:09:18.580
Damn it!

00:09:19.300 --> 00:09:20.940
Sorry about that, Ryang-Ha.

00:09:21.350 --> 00:09:23.040
Don't let it get to you.

00:09:23.040 --> 00:09:25.710
No, he's right.

00:09:25.710 --> 00:09:29.050
I don't think I'm cut out for it, either.

00:09:30.090 --> 00:09:33.660
It's really eating at him that 
you're getting promoted

00:09:33.660 --> 00:09:34.920
when he was here first.

00:09:35.330 --> 00:09:36.630
Be gentle with him.

00:09:38.330 --> 00:09:40.660
I envy Hou, though.

00:09:40.660 --> 00:09:41.810
He's so free.

00:09:41.810 --> 00:09:44.930
That's the kind of comment 
that pisses him off.

00:09:46.500 --> 00:09:47.800
I'm just being honest.

00:09:48.180 --> 00:09:49.350
Really.

00:10:08.440 --> 00:10:10.230
They've just arrived.

00:10:11.460 --> 00:10:13.680
There's no telling what'll happen.

00:10:13.680 --> 00:10:15.210
Be on your guard.

00:10:17.240 --> 00:10:19.910
Hou's poutier than ever today.

00:10:19.910 --> 00:10:23.260
He's angry because Seung-Woo is 
giving Ryang-Ha all the attention.

00:10:23.260 --> 00:10:27.110
I heard Ryang-Ha's even been nominated 
to join the executives.

00:10:27.970 --> 00:10:30.900
It's not just that.

00:10:30.900 --> 00:10:35.080
Something's just not right about him.

00:10:53.750 --> 00:10:54.860
Seung-Woo.

00:10:56.150 --> 00:10:57.750
Hey, evening.

00:10:57.750 --> 00:10:59.570
Done making the rounds?

00:10:59.940 --> 00:11:00.670
Yeah.

00:11:00.670 --> 00:11:02.010
Want a smoke?

00:11:02.010 --> 00:11:03.960
Thanks, but I'll pass.

00:11:03.960 --> 00:11:06.270
Right. You don't smoke.

00:11:06.270 --> 00:11:07.620
I'm sorry.

00:11:14.270 --> 00:11:20.890
Though, like it or not, you'll have
 to play along going forward.

00:11:21.220 --> 00:11:24.330
You can become a target for 
the pettiest of reasons.

00:11:24.710 --> 00:11:27.620
A lot of people find you annoying.

00:11:28.150 --> 00:11:29.410
Be careful.

00:11:30.040 --> 00:11:30.910
Oh, right...

00:11:31.560 --> 00:11:33.430
Keep your schedule clear tomorrow.

00:11:33.430 --> 00:11:35.530
Let's go out for dinner with Hou.

00:11:35.530 --> 00:11:37.340
We have to celebrate for you.

00:11:37.340 --> 00:11:39.550
Although, he gets upset when I say that.

00:11:40.330 --> 00:11:42.300
Tomorrow?

00:11:42.570 --> 00:11:45.220
Hou's got his problems, but so do you.

00:11:45.220 --> 00:11:48.810
You do have a tendency to provoke him.

00:11:49.140 --> 00:11:52.020
Why don't you two sit down 
and talk it out for once?

00:11:52.020 --> 00:11:54.520
It'd be great if you could get along.

00:11:54.520 --> 00:11:58.480
I'm sorry. I can't make it tomorrow.

00:12:30.510 --> 00:12:33.020
Seriously, what's going on?

00:12:33.020 --> 00:12:37.380
You don't pick up the phone, 
and your car runs off a cliff...

00:12:39.460 --> 00:12:41.650
I'd like an explanation from the top.

00:12:41.980 --> 00:12:43.860
Are you listening, Chateau?!

00:12:45.810 --> 00:12:48.160
<i>I'd prefer thanks to an apology.</i>

00:12:50.150 --> 00:12:51.670
<i>I'm exhausted.</i>

00:12:52.160 --> 00:12:55.540
Chateau, I expect an explanation.

00:12:56.600 --> 00:12:58.040
She's asleep.

00:12:58.040 --> 00:12:59.860
Argh!

00:13:17.080 --> 00:13:21.650
Chateau, you can raise your head already.

00:13:26.660 --> 00:13:29.240
I need more than "I'm sorry" to understand.

00:13:29.480 --> 00:13:31.440
I'm asking you what happened.

00:13:31.440 --> 00:13:32.490
Explain!

00:13:33.580 --> 00:13:35.580
I'll pay for the car.

00:13:35.990 --> 00:13:38.010
You have my apologies.

00:13:42.690 --> 00:13:45.130
Fine, just tell me one thing.

00:13:45.130 --> 00:13:48.390
Are you already in contact 
with Ryang-Ha Song?

00:13:52.210 --> 00:13:53.810
I'm sorry.

00:14:13.390 --> 00:14:17.330
Boss, Chateau just left.

00:14:17.330 --> 00:14:18.670
Is that okay?

00:14:20.950 --> 00:14:22.420
Boss?

00:15:17.950 --> 00:15:19.480
Welcome home.

00:15:24.050 --> 00:15:26.070
Your place looks tiny.

00:15:26.070 --> 00:15:28.230
And it's so far from the station. And so old.

00:15:28.610 --> 00:15:30.310
Why are you here?

00:15:30.310 --> 00:15:31.950
How did you even find out—

00:15:31.950 --> 00:15:32.890
Oh, come on.

00:15:32.890 --> 00:15:35.620
I just came to make sure you're okay.

00:15:37.140 --> 00:15:38.980
I don't need your concern.

00:15:38.980 --> 00:15:40.000
Please leave.

00:15:47.070 --> 00:15:48.760
What do you want?

00:15:50.010 --> 00:15:51.760
You're going to let me in, aren't you?

00:15:53.260 --> 00:15:54.430
Here, look.

00:15:54.430 --> 00:15:56.110
I even brought a gift.

00:15:56.110 --> 00:15:59.400
It's from a really popular shop.

00:15:59.400 --> 00:16:01.350
I waited in line for half an hour.

00:16:02.620 --> 00:16:05.610
Wait, are you putting your guard up?

00:16:05.610 --> 00:16:07.010
Well, that's not nice.

00:16:07.010 --> 00:16:10.610
I'm only doing this as part 
of our business relationship.

00:16:14.810 --> 00:16:17.160
<i>I can't have him camping out, either...</i>

00:16:26.380 --> 00:16:28.020
Oh, may I?

00:16:28.020 --> 00:16:29.190
Yay!

00:16:31.260 --> 00:16:34.260
Please take your shoes off at the door.

00:16:35.610 --> 00:16:37.760
Thanks for having me.

00:16:43.940 --> 00:16:45.750
It's a studio apartment.

00:16:45.750 --> 00:16:47.560
You don't have a bed, huh?

00:16:47.790 --> 00:16:49.960
Isn't this room too small for you?

00:16:49.960 --> 00:16:52.320
I know it's just you here, but...

00:16:52.320 --> 00:16:54.350
Oh, these are cream puffs, by the way.

00:16:54.350 --> 00:16:56.070
We shouldn't need
 cream or sugar for our tea.

00:16:58.320 --> 00:17:00.920
Oh, is this a sofa bed?

00:17:01.400 --> 00:17:03.830
It's a little small for me.

00:17:17.190 --> 00:17:19.720
Hey, is this you?

00:17:20.230 --> 00:17:23.010
Are these your parents 
in this photo with you?

00:17:25.720 --> 00:17:28.770
That's none of your business.

00:17:38.050 --> 00:17:41.240
It's not, but I am interested.

00:17:41.940 --> 00:17:43.750
It's about you, after all.

00:17:57.590 --> 00:17:59.480
Aw, are you not having any?

00:17:59.830 --> 00:18:02.890
Come on. I haven't spiked them or anything.

00:18:08.200 --> 00:18:10.210
Are you done with work for the day?

00:18:10.210 --> 00:18:12.310
You came home pretty late.

00:18:12.310 --> 00:18:14.650
Did you get punished or something?

00:18:19.010 --> 00:18:20.900
Oh, boy. Right on the money, huh?

00:18:20.900 --> 00:18:22.910
I feel responsible.

00:18:23.820 --> 00:18:26.040
Did they put you on probation?

00:18:34.210 --> 00:18:38.050
My agency knows that I'm in contact with you.

00:18:42.460 --> 00:18:43.300
So?

00:18:43.610 --> 00:18:45.190
"So"?

00:18:45.190 --> 00:18:50.810
Actually, your boss shouldn't 
be able to get between us.

00:18:51.750 --> 00:18:54.810
Now that they've made a profit off of me,

00:18:54.810 --> 00:18:57.820
they'll be the ones in 
trouble if word gets out.

00:18:58.120 --> 00:19:01.540
If anything, they'll either try 
to continue making use of me,

00:19:01.540 --> 00:19:05.330
or they'll have you get 
rid of me to cover it up.

00:19:06.190 --> 00:19:08.670
What you do is up to you.

00:19:12.630 --> 00:19:13.860
I don't get it.

00:19:16.920 --> 00:19:20.940
You're well aware that you're putting 
your own safety on the line.

00:19:21.540 --> 00:19:25.890
I don't understand what you stand
 to gain by being in contact with me.

00:19:31.650 --> 00:19:33.400
What about you?

00:19:33.400 --> 00:19:36.050
What? I—

00:19:35.030 --> 00:19:37.780
We're both putting ourselves at risk, aren't we?

00:19:37.780 --> 00:19:40.730
In fact, you just had a brush with danger.

00:19:40.730 --> 00:19:42.240
Because of something concerning me.

00:19:54.040 --> 00:19:57.900
If you're so wary of me, 
why haven't you rejected me?

00:19:58.550 --> 00:20:03.570
Couldn't you capture me in this 
situation if you make use of your men?

00:20:05.020 --> 00:20:05.850
Well?

00:20:07.540 --> 00:20:12.180
What are you <i>really</i> looking to get out of me?

00:20:13.150 --> 00:20:14.690
What are you...

00:20:24.860 --> 00:20:27.420
<i>I'm not home at the moment.</i>

00:20:28.140 --> 00:20:32.210
<i>Please leave a message after the tone.</i>

00:20:35.150 --> 00:20:37.610
<i>Hello? It's me, Mom.</i>

00:20:37.610 --> 00:20:40.120
<i>I'm sorry. I know you're busy with work.</i>

00:20:40.120 --> 00:20:42.840
<i>You haven't contacted me in a while.</i>

00:20:42.840 --> 00:20:44.590
Shouldn't you get that?

00:20:45.170 --> 00:20:47.940
<i>The anniversary of your dad's death
 is coming up soon, remember?</i>

00:20:47.940 --> 00:20:49.340
<i>Can you make it home?</i>

00:20:49.740 --> 00:20:51.800
<i>Call me when you can.</i>

00:20:51.800 --> 00:20:52.830
<i>Bye.</i>

00:20:54.660 --> 00:21:00.230
<i>5:05 PM. One recorded message.</i>

00:21:05.610 --> 00:21:07.070
I came at a bad time.

00:21:07.330 --> 00:21:08.950
Sorry. I'll go.

00:21:10.950 --> 00:21:12.340
Oh, right...

00:21:14.940 --> 00:21:17.880
You shouldn't let strangers 
into your place so easily.

00:21:18.470 --> 00:21:20.460
There are some bad people out there.

00:21:23.460 --> 00:21:24.920
I'll contact you again.

00:23:36.700 --> 00:23:39.170
Next episode: "Real Face."
